---
import Header from './components/Header.astro';
import Footer from './components/Footer.astro';
import ArticleCard from './components/ArticleCard.astro';
import Avatar from './components/Avatar.astro';
import './styles/anonime.css';

const { site = {}, article = {} } = Astro.props;
const blogPath = site.blogPath ?? '/articles';
const title = article.title ?? 'Who Needs Encrypted Communication? Scenarios Where Privacy Matters Most';
const category = article.category ?? 'Security';
const excerpt =
  article.excerpt ??
  'Explore real cases where encrypted communication is essential for protecting sensitive business information and safeguarding personal privacy.';

const articleBody =
  article.html ??
  article.contentHtml ??
  `
    <p>In today\'s digital world, nearly every conversation leaves a trace. Emails are scanned, messages are logged, and data is stored for longer than most people realize. Encrypted communication changes that.</p>
    <p>It ensures that only the intended recipient can read the message - not your provider, not hackers, not even governments. But who really needs it? The answer may surprise you.</p>
    <h2 id="individuals">1. Individuals Protecting Their Personal Lives</h2>
    <p>From dating apps to medical consultations, we share deeply personal information online. Without encryption, this data can be exposed in breaches or sold to third parties.</p>
    <blockquote><p>Privacy is not about hiding something. It is about protecting the right to be left alone.</p></blockquote>
    <p>Encrypted messaging ensures your conversations stay between you and the people you trust.</p>
    <h2 id="businesses">2. Businesses Handling Sensitive Information</h2>
    <p>Companies deal with confidential data every day - finances, client details, product plans, and more. A single leak can damage trust and cost millions.</p>
    <div class="anonime-inline-callout">
      <div class="anonime-callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none">
          <path d="M12 3.2 4.7 6.8v5.2c0 4.9 3.5 8.5 7.3 9.8 3.8-1.3 7.3-4.9 7.3-9.8V6.8L12 3.2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p>Encrypted communication helps teams share, collaborate, and operate securely.</p>
    </div>
    <p>Whether you are a startup or an enterprise, encryption is now a business essential.</p>
    <h2 id="journalists">3. Journalists, Activists, and Communities at Risk</h2>
    <p>For those who speak truth to power, privacy is safety. Encrypted communication protects sources, organizes movements, and ensures critical information reaches the right people.</p>
    <div class="anonime-inline-callout">
      <div class="anonime-callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none">
          <path d="M7.5 11.2V8.8a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 9 0v2.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <rect x="6.5" y="11.2" width="11" height="8.5" rx="2.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p>In high-risk environments, encryption can be the difference between exposure and protection.</p>
    </div>
    <h2 id="bottom-line">The Bottom Line</h2>
    <p>Encrypted communication isn\'t just for tech experts or security professionals. It is for anyone who values privacy, security, and control over their words and data.</p>
  `;

const toc = Astro.props.toc ?? [
  { id: 'individuals', label: 'Individuals Protecting Their Personal Lives', active: true },
  { id: 'businesses', label: 'Businesses Handling Sensitive Information' },
  { id: 'journalists', label: 'Journalists, Activists, and Communities at Risk' },
  { id: 'bottom-line', label: 'The Bottom Line' },
];

const relatedArticles = Astro.props.relatedArticles ?? [
  {
    title: 'Beyond Encryption: Zero-Knowledge Architecture and Why It Matters',
    publishedAt: 'Jan 24, 2026',
    readTime: '5 min read',
    slug: 'beyond-encryption',
    artVariant: 'shield',
    hrefBase: blogPath,
  },
  {
    title: 'Why Your Email Address Is Your Biggest Privacy Liability',
    publishedAt: 'Jan 22, 2026',
    readTime: '3 min read',
    slug: 'email-liability',
    artVariant: 'shield',
    hrefBase: blogPath,
  },
  {
    title: 'The Hidden Risks of Data Brokers',
    publishedAt: 'Jan 18, 2026',
    readTime: '4 min read',
    slug: 'hidden-risks-of-data-brokers',
    artVariant: 'paper',
    hrefBase: blogPath,
  },
  {
    title: 'Digital Minimalism: Owning Less of Yourself Online',
    publishedAt: 'Jan 16, 2026',
    readTime: '6 min read',
    slug: 'digital-minimalism',
    artVariant: 'fingerprint',
    hrefBase: blogPath,
  },
];
---

<section class="anonime-template">
  <div class="anonime-shell">
    <Header blogPath={blogPath} />

    <section class="anonime-article-layout anonime-section">
      <article class="anonime-article-main">
        <header class="anonime-article-header">
          <nav class="anonime-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href={blogPath}>Blog</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href={`${blogPath}?category=${encodeURIComponent(category.toLowerCase())}`}>{category}</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>{title}</span>
          </nav>

          <p class="anonime-eyebrow">Secure communication</p>
          <h1 class="anonime-article-heading">{title}</h1>
          <p class="anonime-article-intro">{excerpt}</p>

          <div class="anonime-article-toolbar">
            <div class="anonime-meta-inline">
              <Avatar name={article.authorName ?? 'Rene Carter'} src={article.authorAvatar} alt={article.authorName ?? 'Rene Carter'} />
              <span>{article.authorName ?? 'Rene Carter'}</span>
              <span class="anonime-meta-separator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>{article.publishedAt ?? 'Feb 7, 2026'}</span>
              <span class="anonime-meta-separator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>{article.readTime ?? '5 min read'}</span>
            </div>

            <button class="anonime-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Bookmark article">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 4.8h10v14.7l-5-3.2-5 3.2V4.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="anonime-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Share article">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M16.5 8.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0-2.3-3.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.3 3.5ZM7.5 14.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5Zm9-2a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 2.2 3.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-2.2-3.5ZM9.5 15.6l5.3-2.8m-5.3-2.8 5.3 2.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="anonime-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Copy link">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M9.2 14.8 14.8 9.2m-5.4 6.8a3 3 0 0 1-4.2 0 3 3 0 0 1 0-4.2l2.1-2.1m8.7-.1 2.1-2.1a3 3 0 0 1 4.2 0 3 3 0 0 1 0 4.2l-2.1 2.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="anonime-article-figure">
          {article.image ? (
            <img src={article.image} alt={title} />
          ) : (
            <div class="anonime-featured-hero" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="anonime-featured-lock"></div>
            </div>
          )}
        </figure>

        <div class="anonime-article-body" set:html={articleBody} />

        <footer class="anonime-article-footer">
          <div class="anonime-article-footer-card">
            <div>
              <h3>Your conversations are yours. Keep them that way.</h3>
              <p>Encrypted communication helps protect the people and work that matter most.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="anonime-button" href="#get-started">
              Explore Anonime
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 12h10m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="anonime-article-feedback">
            <span class="anonime-muted">Was this article helpful?</span>
            <button class="anonime-help-button" type="button">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M9.5 11.5V20H6V11.5h3.5Zm1.8-.8 1.6-4.1A2 2 0 0 1 14.8 5h1.4a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.7 2.2l-1 4.2H21v2.4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5.5a2 2 0 0 1-1.9-1.4l-1.8-5a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 1.5-2.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
              Yes
            </button>
            <button class="anonime-help-button" type="button">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M14.5 12.5V4H18v8.5h-3.5Zm-1.8.8-1.6 4.1A2 2 0 0 1 9.2 19H7.8a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.7-2.2l1-4.2H3v-2.4a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5.5a2 2 0 0 1 1.9 1.4l1.8 5a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.5 2.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
              No
            </button>
          </div>
        </footer>
      </article>

      <aside class="anonime-article-sidebar">
        <section class="anonime-panel">
          <h2 class="anonime-panel-title">On this page</h2>
          <ol class="anonime-article-toc-list">
            {toc.map((entry) => (
              <li class={entry.active ? 'is-active' : undefined}>
                <a href={`#${entry.id}`}>{entry.label}</a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="anonime-panel">
          <h2 class="anonime-panel-title">Related Articles</h2>
          <div class="anonime-article-related">
            {relatedArticles.map((related) => (
              <ArticleCard article={related} compact={true} showMeta={true} />
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="anonime-callout">
          <div class="anonime-badge anonime-badge-ghost">Product mission</div>
          <h2 class="anonime-callout-title">Privacy is not just our product. It is our mission.</h2>
          <p class="anonime-callout-copy">Read more insights, guides, and real-world stories on taking back control of your digital life.</p>
          <div class="anonime-callout-actions">
            <a class="anonime-button anonime-button-primary" href={blogPath}>
              Explore all articles
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 12h10m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <Footer blogPath={blogPath} />
  </div>
</section>
